---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Join from '../components/Join.astro';
import Journeys from '../components/Journeys.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Aura | H20"
  description="H20 is the Aura water unit: a generator on the roof and a bottling line inside. It comes later. The machine still needs further research and development."
  descriptor="H20"
>
  <main id="top">
    <canvas class="page-field" data-wash="glass" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
    <canvas class="field-light" data-field="glass" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>

    <section class="page-lead">
      <p class="story-kicker">H20</p>
      <h1 data-glow>
        <span class="line-mask"><span class="line">Water</span></span>
        <span class="line-mask"><span class="line">from the air.</span></span>
      </h1>
      <p class="story-lede">
        H20 comes later. The generator on the roof and the bottling line inside still need further research and development. Homes are the room you can ask for now. Farms are the growing units. This page is the plan for the water unit: moisture from the air, into plain plastic jugs, once that work is done.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="story-still">
      <figure class="story-figure">
        <video poster="/film/water-roof.webp" data-film="/film/scroll/water-roof.mp4" muted playsinline preload="none" disablepictureinpicture width="1248" height="832" data-shot="lift" data-play="rise" aria-label="Black glass shell at dusk with a compact atmospheric water generator on the roof"></video>
      </figure>
      <div>
        <p class="story-kicker">The roof</p>
        <h3><span class="line-mask"><span class="line">A quiet machine.</span></span></h3>
        <p>A low condenser on the roof, not a tower and not a plant you can see from the road. The meadow stays the view.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="story-still is-flip">
      <figure class="story-figure">
        <video poster="/film/water-line.webp" data-film="/film/scroll/water-line.mp4" muted playsinline preload="none" disablepictureinpicture width="1248" height="832" data-shot="drift" data-play="glide" aria-label="Small bottling line and plain plastic jugs inside the oak room"></video>
      </figure>
      <div>
        <p class="story-kicker">The line</p>
        <h3><span class="line-mask"><span class="line">Jugs, inside the room.</span></span></h3>
        <p>A short stainless line, and plastic jugs. Today they can leave plain. The label, when the network exists, is how an advertiser pays for water that is free to the person who takes it.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ways">
      <p class="story-kicker">What the water unit is for</p>
      <ol>
        <li><span>01</span> An atmospheric water generator on the roof</li>
        <li><span>02</span> A micro bottling line</li>
        <li><span>03</span> Plastic jugs, plain or labelled</li>
        <li><span>04</span> The room still livable around the line</li>
      </ol>
      <p class="story-lede">Humidity, power, and local rules will decide the yield. The machine is not ready to place. The research is still open.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="story-open">
      <p class="story-kicker">Later</p>
      <h2 data-glow>
        <span class="line-mask"><span class="line">Not yet.</span></span>
        <span class="line-mask"><span class="line">Still in research.</span></span>
      </h2>
      <p class="story-lede">
        When the work is done, the same shell can make water. You would bottle for yourself, or, in the network we hope to build, an advertiser’s label would pay the operator so the jug can be given away. That network is not live. H20 is not ready to build or to place.
      </p>
      <p class="story-lede"><a href="/journal/water-from-the-air">Read the water note</a>, and <a href="/journal/free-food-and-water">the network</a>.</p>
    </section>

    <Journeys />

    <section id="enquire" class="enquire">
      <p class="story-kicker">Enquire</p>
      <h2 data-glow><span class="line-mask"><span class="line">When H20 is ready.</span></span></h2>
      <p class="story-lede enquire-note">Leave a name if you want the first note, once the research is far enough to talk about a build. This page takes no payment.</p>
      <Join shell="water" />
    </section>
  </main>
  <script>
    import { bindJourneyMotion } from '../scripts/journey';
    bindJourneyMotion();
  </script>
</BaseLayout>
